sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant PostService
    participant PostRepository
    participant ListPost

    Client->>PostService: findAll()
    Note right of Client: Client calls PostService.findAll

    PostService->>PostRepository: findAll()
    Note right of PostService: Service delegates to PostRepository.findAll

    PostRepository->>ListPost: return ListPost
    Note right of PostRepository: List of all Post objects from database

    ListPost-->>PostService: ListPost

    alt Repository throws exception
        PostRepository->>PostService: throw DatabaseException
        Note right of PostRepository: Repository exceptions propagate to caller
        PostService-->>Client: DatabaseException
    else Success
        PostService-->>Client: ListPost
        Note right of PostService: List of Post objects returned to client
    end
